              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vwikaliru vwu kukumberiza mugizi zimbega ziosi kandi vwikaliru vwi kirivwa chu mugizi kandi vivambo viosi vie Lihema kandi viu lugaga lwukukumberiza mugizi.",
